meta {
  name: Phase08-Closed-Deals
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  Two end-to-end deal closures:
    - Adaeze offers ₦2M on Amaka's Ikate → Amaka accepts → Amaka closes the listing
    - Babatunde offers ₦420M on Biodun's Bourdillon → Biodun accepts → Biodun closes

  After this:
    - Amaka has 1 closed listing (Ikate) on her record
    - Biodun has 1 closed listing
    - Emeka (assigned agent on both) has 2 closed deals
    - Adaeze + Babatunde become eligible to leave a review on the closed listings
}
